    "sentence_translations": [
      "Study Tang Poetry – Quiet Night Thought",
      "",
      "Before my bed a pool of light;",
      "",
      "Oh can it be frost on the ground?",
      "",
      "Looking up, I find the moon bright;",
      "",
      "Bowing, in homesickness I'm drowned.",
      "",
      "This is a poem called “Quiet Night Thought”, meaning “thoughts awoken by the quiet night”.",
      "The poem is written by Li Bai, a very famous poet from the Tang dynasty.",
      "In China, a lot of parents like to teach their children poetry, and make them recite poems from 4 years old.",
      "And this “Quiet Night Thought” is a poem that many parents choose to teach their children first.",
      "",
      "This poem was written when Li Bai departed from his hometown to stay in another place.",
      "The poem tells the following: The moonlight that shines before my bed, at first I thought it was hoar frost.",
      "I raise my head to see the bright moon in the sky.",
      "I can't help but bow my head and increasingly start to long for my hometown.",
      ""
    ]
